04-16T17:59:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118654","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118654.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118654.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The driver implementation is basically done.\r\n\r\nI've been working on Mesa's spirv2dxil to add raytracing support to it and I'm nearly there. I temporarily made [my Mesa branch](https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds/mesa/tree/spirv2dxil-rt) into a [godot-nir-static patch](https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds/godot-nir-static/tree/raytracing). The plan later is to contribute it back to the upstream Mesa repository.\r\n\r\nThe shader converter has a few remaining issues that needs to be taken care of:\r\n- [ ] Payload/attribute definitions mismatching between shader stages is UB in D3D12. What can we do when the shader does not define them? GLSL and SPIR-V allow this.\r\n- [ ] Unused resources present in the raytracing DXIL libraries cause the validation to fail.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118654/reactions","total_count":36,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":0,"eyes":7},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118654/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}